└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

Response:
### Electronics Return Policy

For electronics purchases on Amazon, the return window is **15 days from the 
delivery date**. This shorter return period applies specifically to electronic 
items compared to the standard 30-day return policy for most other products.

### Refund Processing Time

When returning an electronic item and choosing a credit card as your refund 
method, you can expect:

**Credit or Debit Card Refunds:** 3-5 business days after Amazon processes your
refund

This means after you initiate the return and Amazon approves your refund 
request, it typically takes 3-5 business days for the funds to appear back in 
your credit card account. The exact timing may vary slightly depending on your 
bank's processing times.

For your recent Kindle Paperwhite order (ORD-002), since you've already 
received approval for your refund, you should see the $139.99 refund appear on 
your credit card statement within the next 3-5 business days.


